actor-demo-giant-piranha-name = 巨型食人鱼
actor-demo-giant-piranha-description = 一条体型惊人、会疯狂撕咬猎物的嗜血鱼类。
actor-demo-owlbear-name = 枭熊
actor-demo-owlbear-description = 一头有着猫头鹰面孔和利爪的庞大熊形怪兽。
