ability-legacy-drain-mana-6-description = 从目标身上吸取 6 点法力。
ability-legacy-heal-30-name = 自我治疗
ability-legacy-heal-30-description = 恢复 30 点生命。
ability-legacy-summon-legacy-import-l10-1d1-name = 召唤怪物
ability-legacy-summon-legacy-import-l10-1d1-description = 召唤一只等级不高于 10 的怪物。
actor-demo-pseudo-dragon-name = 伪龙
